  "text": "Emergency Vet | BluePearl Pet Hospital Birmingham | Hoover, AL\nSkip to the content\nJoin the BluePearl Family!\nWe're hiring.\nFind a Hospital\nSearch the site\nSearch\nSearch the site\nSearch\nResources for Pet Owners\nWhy BluePearl\nIntake Form\nPay with CareCredit\nPet Care Articles and Videos\nStories from the Heart\nResources for Veterinarians\nWhy Refer to BluePearl\nReferral Portal & Medical Records\nOrder BluePearl Materials\nMedical Library for DVMs\nAbout Us\nWho We Are\nOur Areas of Expertise\nNewsroom\nContact Us\nCareers\nFind a Hospital\nHome\nHospitals\nBluePearl Pet Hospital Birmingham Hoover, AL\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nBirmingham\nHoover, AL\nEmergency and Specialty\n205.460.2220\n3470 Galleria Circle\nHoover, AL 35244\n[email protected]\nEmergency:\nMon: 24 hours\nTue: 12 am-6 am; 6 pm-6 am next day\nWed & Thu: 6 pm-6 am next day\nFri-Sun: 24 hours\nSpecialty:\nMon: 8 am-6 pm\nTue: 8 am-6 pm\nWed: 8 am-6 pm\nThu: 8 am-6 pm\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nBluePearl Pet Hospital – serving the greater Birmingham area.\nBluePearl Pet Hospital is an emergency vet and specialty animal hospital located in Hoover, AL at the intersection of Montgomery Hwy and I-459. We serve pets in the greater Birmingham community, including Homewood, Mountain Brook, Vestavia Hills, and other areas south of downtown Birmingham.\nOur reviews.\nOur services.\nWhen your pet needs it most, we’re here to help. Our experienced team of veterinarians, vet technicians and support staff work closely together to provide the comprehensive, compassionate care your pet needs and deserves.\nEmergency\nIn an emergency, please call ahead so we can talk you through your pet's situation and prepare for your arrival. No appointment is necessary for our emergency services.\nSpecialty care\nOur veterinary specialists work directly with your primary care vet to understand your pet’s condition and develop the appropriate treatment plan. Visits to our specialists are usually by referral from your primary care vet and by appointment.\nSee Specialties and Services\nOur\nveterinarians.\nCaring for your pets is our passion. Meet our team of veterinarians here to help you and your pet.\nSee Veterinarians\nAbout BluePearl Pet Hospital Birmingham.\nBluePearl Pet Hospital in Birmingham started as two hospitals – Veterinary Eye Care and Birmingham Internal Medicine. In 2023, we combined the hospitals, moved to a new location and expanded our services.\nVeterinary Eye Care was established in 1993 to serve the greater Birmingham area as a referral ophthalmology practice specializing in diagnosing and treating eye diseases in animals of all species. Advances in veterinary medicine have allowed the growth of specialized medicine – including ophthalmology – that utilizes treatments and techniques formerly reserved only for people.\nBirmingham Veterinary Internal Medicine was established to provide specialty care for pets, and over the years, the team has helped thousands of pets and pet owners in the Birmingham area.\nPet owners.\nAt BluePearl, providing our customers with remarkable service is a top priority. We’re committed to making your veterinary visit as smooth as possible.\nHave questions prior to your visit? We’re happy to help. Contact our hospital team at\n[email protected]\n.\nCurrent location.\n205.460.2220\n3470 Galleria Circle\nHoover,\nAL                                    35244\n[email protected]\nOther hospitals.\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nWestside\nAtlanta, GA\n1071 Howell Mill Rd., Ste. B\nAtlanta, GA 30318\n404.649.6333\n140.67 miles\nBluePearl Pet Rehab + Fitness\nMarietta, GA\n1230 Johnson Ferry Pl., Ste. J-70\nMarietta, GA 30068\n678.803.2626\n143.29 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nSandy Springs, GA\n455 Abernathy Rd. NE\nSandy Springs, GA 30328\n404.459.0903\n145.13 miles\nGet In Touch\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\n2950 Busch Lake Blvd.\nTampa\n, FL\n33614\nContact Us\nFind a Hospital Near Me\nCareers at BluePearl\nBluePearl™ Cares\nWeb Accessibility\nYour Privacy Choices\nStay Connected\nHere for pets.\nWhen it matters most.\nStay connected with BluePearl for expert advice, helpful tips and trusted information to support you and your pet - delivered straight to your inbox.\nSign Up\ncookies notice\nprivacy policy\nlegal\nad choices\nterms & conditions\naccessibility\ncontact us\na\nbrand\n© 2026 BluePearl Holdings LLC. All rights reserved.\nCookie Settings",
